                             Blob Storage
                                --------> S3 in AWS

--> in Blob storage data stored in container.
(AWS : Bucket ----> Azure : Container)
(AWS : Objects ----> Azure : Blob)
--> blob storage is non bootable service
--> min and max capacity of object is 0 byte to  190TB
--> (AWS --> Storage Classes  Azure --> Access tier)
--> Azure access tiers:
1. Hot tier 
--> best for frequently accessd data 
2. Cool tier:
--> best for infrequently accessed data
3. Cold tier:
--> best for rarely accessed data 
--> min 90 days
4. Archive tier:
--> Best for long lived data 